{
  "name": "@godcreator02/livedoc",
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "livedoc：文档里的论断钉在真源码上，代码变了就报出来。一个包五个模块——engine 判定、host 碰环境（git / 盘 / 记录簿 / 摆放）、fumadocs 格式实现与站接线、site 给已有 fumadocs 骨架装六区、cli 命令行（check / confirm / render / trajectory / attach）。随包发两份 skill 与装配模板",
  "bin": {
    "livedoc": "./dist/cli.mjs"
  },
  "//exports": "三个口：`.` 是命令行的 main 加装配的面（测试与程序调用走它），`./fumadocs` 是站接线（source.config.ts import 它），bin 是可执行。/fumadocs/pre 与 /fumadocs/term 是含 React 的侧出口，不能混进 ./fumadocs——pre 那份带 use client 指令",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./dist/index.d.mts",
      "default": "./dist/index.mjs"
    },
    "./fumadocs": {
      "types": "./dist/fumadocs.d.mts",
      "default": "./dist/fumadocs.mjs"
    },
    "./fumadocs/pre": {
      "types": "./dist/pre.d.mts",
      "default": "./dist/pre.mjs"
    },
    "./fumadocs/term": {
      "types": "./dist/term.d.mts",
      "default": "./dist/term.mjs"
    },
    "./fumadocs/light.css": "./styles/light.css",
    "./fumadocs/term.css": "./styles/term.css"
  },
  "files": [
    "dist",
    "styles",
    "skills",
    "template"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsdown",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "prepublishOnly": "pnpm run build"
  },
  "//dependencies": "轨迹是独立包线：它有意不依赖判定层、自己复刻了一部分记号语法，概念上完全独立。remark 那套只给 fumadocs 那一层用",
  "dependencies": {
    "@godcreator02/livedoc-trajectory": "workspace:*",
    "remark-frontmatter": "^5.0.0",
    "remark-mdx": "^3.0.0",
    "remark-parse": "^11.0.0",
    "unified": "^11.0.0"
  },
  "//peerDependencies": "fumadocs 与 react 用消费方项目装的那份，包自己不带——全可选，只跑命令行的仓一个都不必装",
  "peerDependencies": {
    "fumadocs-core": ">=16",
    "fumadocs-mdx": ">=15",
    "fumadocs-ui": ">=16",
    "react": ">=19"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "fumadocs-core": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "fumadocs-mdx": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "fumadocs-ui": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "react": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/react": "^19.2.18",
    "fumadocs-ui": "npm:@fumadocs/base-ui@16.15.1",
    "react": "^19.2.8"
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  }
}
